<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Enterprise raised at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enterprise raised at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Oil Plc was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The brokerage was said to have set a 12-month price target of 800p on the stock, though analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5p at 710 by 0947 GMT in volume of just over half a million shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
